Important reminders:

For all Cam*_Zone, Col_*, Door_*, Interact_* objects:
1. Keep them axis-aligned for now
2. Apply transforms: Ctrl + A -> Rotation & Scale!!!!
3. Make zones and doors tall in Blender Z, because Blender Z will be transformer to Y by the engine
4. For the doors, create a cube that will act as a trigger zone for door transition, add a custom property called "targetRoom" as String and then put the path
to the .json of the next room
*For interactions, also have the properties id (string), type (string), asset (the image's path in string format) and repeatable (bool) added. (message also can laso be added as a property but it is aimed towards the type "message" lol)

